# Video Feedback Feature — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A side-by-side comparison video that's generated after each dance comparison session. The video shows teacher (left) and student (right) with:
- **Green skeleton** on both dancers
- **Blue ghost skeleton** of the teacher overlaid on the student's frames

